We consider the foster care system for these children to be a protective zone.
The goal of our foster care system is to provide safe homes, loving caregivers, stable education, and reliable health care.
The purpose of foster care is to fulfill all the necessary needs that were missing in the home from which they were taken.
The internet connects elements of both large-scale and interpersonal communication.
The distinctive features of the internet are that it takes an additional perspective in terms of usability and satisfying user experience.
